<title>AUSTRIA: Austria to issue 20 bln ats 5-yr bond on Feb 25.</title>
<headline>Austria to issue 20 bln ats 5-yr bond on Feb 25.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Austria will issue a five-year bond with a volume of 20 billion schillings on February 25, the Austrian Kontrollbank said on Monday.</p>
<p>The new bond will mature on February 28, 2002.</p>
<p>Last month Austria issued a 5.625 percent 10-year bond, maturing January 17, 2007. -- Vienna newsroom, +43-1 531 12 254</p>
